Tables computed from stock values (T865XXU6DXE1 vendor image); the numbers are
Samsung's tuning, the files and their format are written for this port:

  - configs/display/display_id_4630947232161729153.xml: brightness curve,
    automatic brightness levels and sunlight boost threshold from the vendor
    framework overlay (vendor/overlay/framework-res__auto_generated_rro_vendor.apk:
    config_screenBrightnessBacklight, config_screenBrightnessNits,
    config_autoBrightnessLevels, config_autoBrightnessDisplayValuesNits,
    config_autoBrightnessHbmAmbientLux); thermal brightness limits from
    etc/siop_gts6l_sm8150.xml.
  - configs/thermal/thermal_info_config.json: skin temperature estimate
    (sensor weights and offsets) from etc/mercury.json; thresholds from
    etc/siop_gts6l_sm8150.xml.
